# Neon connection string for the BFF catalog read (NH-279). The Next.js server component queries
# Neon directly (hybrid BFF topology, ADR 2026-07-08 Decision 2). Copy to .env.local and fill in.
#
# Use a Neon **dev branch** URL locally so dev work never spends prod compute-hours.
# Production: set DATABASE_URL in Vercel environment variables (not committed).
DATABASE_URL=postgres://<user>:<password>@<host>/<db>?sslmode=require
